{"nodes": [{"id": "web_index_consent_default_block", "label": "Consent Mode Default Block (inline head script)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 14-19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Defines gtag() and sets consent defaults: all signals granted unless localStorage rb_cookies_v3 == 'min' (opt-out model). Must stay before the GTM snippet; identical block on the 3 pages. The localStorage read is try-guarded because getItem can throw under blocked cookies / strict private browsing."}, {"id": "web_index_gtm_snippet", "label": "GTM Loader Snippet", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 21-26 + noscript 764-767", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_gtag", "label": "gtag()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "line 15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_acceptcookies", "label": "acceptCookies()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 2058-2067", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Applies the consent update BEFORE the guarded localStorage write: setItem can throw (blocked cookies, strict private browsing), and if it threw first a refusal would be neither applied nor stored, leaving the banner frozen with measurement still active."}, {"id": "web_index_rouvrircookies", "label": "rouvrirCookies()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 2055-2057", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CNIL principle: withdrawing consent must be as easy as giving it \u2014 the footer link 'G\u00e9rer mes cookies' re-shows the banner and the next choice overwrites the old one via acceptCookies."}, {"id": "web_index_cookiebar", "label": "#cookieBar Cookie Banner", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 2041-2045", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Declares the three purposes (technical, audience measurement, Google Ads conversion). The Refuse button is styled with the same legibility as Accept because the CNIL has sanctioned contrast that steers the choice. Shown only when no rb_cookies_v3 choice is stored."}, {"id": "web_index_section_vue_observer", "label": "section_vue IntersectionObserver", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 2083-2112", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GA4 already measures scroll depth but not WHICH part of the site retains the visitor \u2014 Romain's real question (which van, rental vs custom conversion). One push per section per load; uses rootMargin instead of a percentage threshold because a section taller than the viewport would never trigger on mobile; SLUGS map remaps carousel data-id 'penelope' to reservation slug 'penelop' so views and conversions join per vehicle in GA4."}, {"id": "web_index_submitcalendarbooking", "label": "submitCalendarBooking()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1443-1538", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Public-site booking submit: validates fields, writes via Supabase RPC submit_booking, then pushes demande_reservation to dataLayer only AFTER the DB write and in its own try \u2014 GTM replaces dataLayer.push with a function that runs tags synchronously, so a faulty tag added later in the GTM UI must not fail the rest of the send (web3forms notification email). Button locked during the request; 'Dates indisponibles' errors get a dedicated toast."}, {"id": "web_index_submitcontact", "label": "submitContact()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1562-1593", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_submitdevis", "label": "submitDevis()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1669-1729", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Custom-conversion quote request: sends via web3forms then replaces the #devis section with an HTML-escaped recap (escHtml guards user input injected into innerHTML)."}, {"id": "web_index_showtoast", "label": "showToast()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1544-1550 and 1555-1560", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Defined twice in the same script block (3500 ms then 4500 ms timeout); the second definition silently wins \u2014 latent duplication to clean up."}, {"id": "web_index_rendercal", "label": "renderCal()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1333-1370", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_pickday", "label": "pickDay()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1372-1388", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Range selection guards against picking a period that spans booked dates (walks day by day between start and end)."}, {"id": "web_index_selectvehicle", "label": "selectVehicle()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1304-1312", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_isbooked", "label": "isBooked()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1316-1318", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "statut 'confirmee' blocks dates (red); 'option' is a pending, still-bookable request (yellow) handled by isOption()."}, {"id": "web_index_loadreservations", "label": "loadReservations()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1283-1287", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_savereservations", "label": "saveReservations()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1289-1291", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_showbookingform", "label": "showBookingForm()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1413-1427", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_opencalendarmodal", "label": "openCalendarModal()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1740-1751", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_initvancarousels", "label": "initVanCarousels()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1815-1907", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Builds each van carousel from data-id/data-folder/data-count attributes: slides, arrows, dots, touch/mouse swipe, tap-to-zoom into the lightbox, autoplay with pause on hover and on tab hidden."}, {"id": "web_index_openvanlightbox", "label": "openVanLightbox()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1768-1774", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_index_rbcapso_reservations_v2", "label": "localStorage rbcapso_reservations_v2 Store", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1283-1293", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Client-side reservation cache read by the calendar. No seed data in the page: booking-bridge.js (loaded deferred) populates this key from Supabase at page load, decoupling calendar rendering from network state."}, {"id": "web_index_submit_booking_rpc", "label": "Supabase submit_booking RPC (client call)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 1474-1481", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Server-side booking write with availability enforcement: returns 'Dates indisponibles' when the period was just taken, which the UI surfaces as a dedicated message."}, {"id": "web_index_web3forms_integration", "label": "web3forms Email Notification Integration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "access_key a7079c4b-dcd4-4354-994e-f44e8f3e6047", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single api.web3forms.com endpoint used by all three public forms (booking, contact, quote) to email Romain; the booking email ends with '\u00c0 confirmer dans /app', wiring the human follow-up loop."}, {"id": "web_index_jsonld_business", "label": "LocalBusiness/AutoRental JSON-LD Structured Data", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 52-172", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "schema.org graph: LocalBusiness+AutoRental with geo, areaServed, opening hours, founder, plus two Service nodes (rental with an OfferCatalog pricing the fleet 40-120 EUR/day, and custom conversion) and a WebSite node."}, {"id": "web_index_jsonld_faq", "label": "FAQPage JSON-LD Structured Data", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 173-220", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mirrors the on-page #faq section (permit, animals, pickup, deposit, cancellation, mileage, insurance, sport gear) for rich results."}, {"id": "web_index_vehicle_fleet", "label": "Vehicle Fleet (P\u00e9n\u00e9lope, Peggy, Tente de toit)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "VEHICLE_NAMES / VEHICLE_PRICES, lines 1270-1280", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Canonical slugs penelop / peggy / tente (note: penelop without final e) with prices 120 / 95 / 50 EUR-day; the same slugs flow through booking, analytics events and the /stats dashboard so every layer joins on vehicle."}, {"id": "web_index_contact_links", "label": "Contact Action Links (tel / WhatsApp / Instagram / Maps)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 941-956", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "web_index_gtm_snippet", "target": "analytics_gtm_mrm597nw", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "line 25", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_consent_default_block", "target": "web_index_gtag", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "line 18", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_consent_default_block", "target": "analytics_rb_cookies_v3", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "line 16", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_consent_default_block", "target": "analytics_consent_mode_v2", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "web/index.html", "source_location": "lines 6-19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "web_index_acceptcookies", "target": "web_index_gtag", "relation"